      "id": "bbc-2026-09-10-bernie-sanders-speaks-to-the-bbc-about-proposal-to-ban-ai-su",
      "title": "Bernie Sanders speaks to the BBC about proposal to ban AI superintelligence",
      "summary": "The senator has also proposed a sort of sovereign wealth fund in which the US would take a 50% stake in AI companies.",
      "body": "US Senator Bernie Sanders recently said he intends to introduce legislation banning AI superintelligence and propose a sort of sovereign wealth fund in which the US would take a 50% stake in AI companies.Sanders, who is an independent but often collaborates with his Democratic lawmaker colleagues, would need to pass both houses of Congress - currently held by Republicans - and be signed by President Donald Trump to become law. Trump has championed US government investment in AI companies, to \"create almost a partnership with the American public\".The US senator spoke to BBC Newsnight about his concerns about artificial intelligence overtaking humanity.",
