      "body": "Up Next. Céline Dion fans prepare for comeback concert in Paris. Video, 00:00:51SubsectionCulturePublished8 hours ago'We will never, ever forget' - Americans remember 9/11 on 25th anniversary. Video, 00:01:20SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished1 day agoCéline Dion duets with fan ahead of Paris comeback concert. Video, 00:01:17SubsectionEuropePublished1 day agoHow global trade and oil prices could be hit by Houthi advance. Video, 00:02:15SubsectionMiddle EastPublished1 day agoHas Trump won over voters with his midterm convention? Video, 00:01:08SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished1 day agoWatch: Americans remember what they were doing on 9/11. Video, 00:02:00SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished1 day agoDrone display recreates the Twin Towers over New York City. Video, 00:00:36SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days agoBrother of Muslim police cadet killed in 9/11 'disappointed' by calls for Mamdani to sit out memorial. Video, 00:01:59SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished1 day agoWatch: Three times Trump has promised money to Americans. Video, 00:01:23SubsectionBusinessPublished2 days agoWatch: Is the Bayeux Tapestry exhibition worth the hype? Video, 00:01:03SubsectionEuropePublished2 days agoGruffalo Granny illustrator says rise of AI images 'worrying' Video, 00:01:20SectionNewsPublished2 days ago",
