      "title": "Pusheen’s first game is coming to Apple Arcade",
      "summary": "Pusheen is getting her first game, and it will appear exclusively on Apple Arcade. Launching October 1st, Pusheen's Place lets you collect and care for more than 100 Pusheens as you play minigames and decorate rooms for Pusheenicorn, Pancake Pusheen, and other variations of the cartoon cat.\nIn the mix of minigames, you'll \"sort color cakes in Snack Stack,\" \"pop cute Pusheen fruit bubbles in Parfai",
      "body": "Pusheen is getting her first game, and it will appear exclusively on Apple Arcade. Launching October 1st, Pusheen’s Place lets you collect and care for more than 100 Pusheens as you play minigames and decorate rooms for Pusheenicorn, Pancake Pusheen, and other variations of the cartoon cat.\nIn the mix of minigames, you’ll “sort color cakes in Snack Stack,” “pop cute Pusheen fruit bubbles in Parfait Pop,” “make delicious matches and blast blockers in Batch Match,” and solve puzzles, according to the game’s description on the App Store. The game’s developers will also continue to add “more Pusheens, decor themes, games and features” over time.\nAlong with Pusheen’s Place, Apple is adding several other games to its $6.99 / month Arcade subscription next month, including the sandbox adventure game Terraria, a zombie horde-fighting game River City Survivors, the physics-based BMX stunt game Touchgrind BMX 2, and the puzzle game 4 Pics 1 Word.",
