      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/03/STK095_MICROSOFT_2_CVirginia_C.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,10.732984293194,100,78.534031413613",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/991178/microsoft-patch-tuesday-record-breaking-ai-notepad",
